Take your ambitions to the next level


You will manage the business analysis, software development, implementation and production support for either 1 large or 2-3 small projects. You will be responsible for the overall project management, including budget, planning/estimation, recruiting, resource planning, delivery and implementation. You will communicate project direction and status to the client, manage client expectations, and build successful client relationships.


The work is primarily in the Midwest and Eastern United States. Must be willing to travel but can be in either the US or Canada.


